#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:5 eb88fb62ea3b4c5d9cc25a89d2afe13d
msgid "Tricopter Configuration"
msgstr "三旋翼配置"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:7 ea40c96a46c54c408b9511fa7d5c3f7e
msgid ""
"This page outlines the special settings required to get a TriCopter flying."
"  The more :ref:`general instructions for setting up a multicopter <initial-"
"setup>` should be used for all other aspects of the setup."
msgstr "本页面概述了让三旋翼飞行所需的特殊设置。其他所有设置方面应参考 :ref:`多旋翼通用设置说明 <initial-setup>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:14 f2503b4324e94d26894d96d7aaff9cff
msgid "After loading the firmware please set:"
msgstr "加载固件后，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:16 2a94cf462c3e4c60b28b86ac7eba6a80
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` to 7 (\"Tri\")"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 设置为 7（\"Tri\"）"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:18 a0d117a15d8d4359bb35a0a3fca10a45
msgid ""
"Better separation of RC input and output parameters has also lead to some "
"changes compared to earlier versions.  Here is a full list of tricopter "
"specific parameters:"
msgstr "RC 输入和输出参数的更好分离也导致与早期版本相比的一些变化。以下是三旋翼特定参数的完整列表："

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:20 856703317bdf4419bfaf1ab59430ec14
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE <MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE>`: tail servo's maximum lean angle "
"in degrees.  This allows for the rear motor's thrust to be adjusted "
"appropriately depending upon the lean angle of the rear motor.  The default "
"is 30 degrees.  \"0\" would mean the tail servo can only point directly up "
"(which would not allow the vehicle to fly), \"90\" means the tail servo can "
"point horizontally."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE "
"<MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE>`：尾部舵机的最大倾斜角度（度）。这允许根据后部电机的倾斜角度适当调整后部电机的推力。默认值为 30 度。\"0\""
" 表示尾部舵机只能垂直向上指（这样飞行器无法飞行），\"90\" 表示尾部舵机可以水平指向。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:21 408c1c5148e54031877559da8792e293
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO7_MIN <SERVO7_MIN>`: tail servo's lowest PWM value before binding"
" occurs."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO7_MIN <SERVO7_MIN>`：尾部舵机在发生堵转前的最低 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:22 94d7b6e135fa49968a97d61ae14e1c55
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO7_MAX <SERVO7_MAX>`: tail servo's highest PWM value before "
"binding occurs."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO7_MAX <SERVO7_MAX>`：尾部舵机在发生堵转前的最高 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:23 1a02f4daa37c4e198302dc0365bfbb43
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO7_TRIM <SERVO7_TRIM>`: tail servo's PWM value close to what is "
"required to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO7_TRIM <SERVO7_TRIM>`：接近阻止尾部旋转所需的尾部舵机 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:24 c77a66870b05449f97d1e1fc7e6c9240
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO7_REVERSED <SERVO7_REVERSED>`: tail servo's reverse setting.  0 ="
" servo moves in default direction, 1 to reverse direction of movement."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO7_REVERSED <SERVO7_REVERSED>`：尾部舵机的反向设置。0 = 舵机按默认方向移动，1 = 反转移动方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/tricopter.rst:26 36b518a9c98e41e5814a37380c877a34
msgid ""
"The RC output channel used for the tail servo can be changed from its "
"default (channel 7) by setting the appropriate SERVOX_FUNCTION to 39. For "
"example the :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` only has 6 output "
"channels so the tail servo can be moved to output channel 5 by setting "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` to 39. Note that if the output "
"channel is changed, the SERVOx_MIN, SERVOx_MAX, SERVOx_TRIM and "
"SERVOx_REVERSED must be set appropriately for the new output channel."
msgstr ""
"用于尾部舵机的 RC 输出通道可以通过将相应的 SERVOX_FUNCTION 设置为 39 来从默认值（通道 "
"7）更改。例如，:ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 只有 6 个输出通道，因此可以通过将 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 设置为 39 将尾部舵机移至输出通道 "
"5。请注意，如果更改了输出通道，必须为新输出通道适当设置 SERVOx_MIN、SERVOx_MAX、SERVOx_TRIM 和 "
"SERVOx_REVERSED。"
